## CSS Snippet

```css
:root {
  --trail-color: 108, 99, 255; /* RGB values for use in rgba() */
}

/* Horizontal trail — shadows offset to the left (opposite of rightward motion) */
@keyframes sweep-right {
  from { transform: translateX(-60px); }
  to   { transform: translateX(60px); }
}

.trail-horizontal {
  filter:
    drop-shadow(-6px  0 2px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.75))
    drop-shadow(-13px 0 5px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.50))
    drop-shadow(-22px 0 9px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.28))
    drop-shadow(-33px 0 15px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.12));
  animation: sweep-right 1.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

/* Vertical trail — shadows offset upward (opposite of downward fall) */
@keyframes fall-down {
  from { transform: translateY(-50px); }
  to   { transform: translateY(50px); }
}

.trail-vertical {
  filter:
    drop-shadow(0 -6px  2px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.75))
    drop-shadow(0 -14px 5px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.45))
    drop-shadow(0 -24px 9px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.22));
  animation: fall-down 1.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

/* Diagonal trail */
@keyframes bounce-diagonal {
  from { transform: translate(-40px, -40px); }
  to   { transform: translate(40px, 40px); }
}

.trail-diagonal {
  filter:
    drop-shadow(-5px -5px  3px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.70))
    drop-shadow(-11px -11px 6px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.40))
    drop-shadow(-20px -20px 12px rgba(var(--trail-color), 0.18));
  animation: bounce-diagonal 1.4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  /* Performance: promote to compositor layer */
  will-change: filter, transform;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .trail-horizontal,
  .trail-vertical,
  .trail-diagonal {
    animation: none;
    filter: none;
  }
}
```

---

## Visual Reference

Each animated element appears to drag a luminous comet tail behind it in the direction opposite to its movement. The effect works on SVG elements with transparency (where `box-shadow` would fail, as it renders on the bounding box). The `will-change: filter` hint ensures the filter is GPU-composited for smooth 60fps animation.

