## CSS Snippet

```css
/* Closed circular path using SVG arc command */
/* The arc closes back on itself to form a full circle */
@keyframes orbit-loop {
  from { offset-distance: 0%; }
  to   { offset-distance: 100%; }
}

.orbit-container {
  position: relative;
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

/* Circular orbit path: radius 80px centered at 100,100 */
.orbit-satellite {
  position: absolute;
  offset-path: path("M 180 100 A 80 80 0 1 1 179.999 100 Z");
  offset-rotate: auto;
  animation: orbit-loop 3s linear infinite;
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
}

/* Elliptical orbit: 120×60px ellipse */
.orbit-dot {
  position: absolute;
  offset-path: path("M 220 100 A 120 60 0 1 1 219.999 100 Z");
  offset-rotate: 0deg; /* keep dots upright while orbiting */
  animation: orbit-loop 4s linear infinite;
  animation-delay: var(--delay, 0s);
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #6c63ff;
}

/* Hover to pause */
.orbit-container:hover .orbit-satellite,
.orbit-container:hover .orbit-dot {
  animation-play-state: paused;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .orbit-satellite,
  .orbit-dot {
    animation: none;
    offset-distance: 0%;
  }
}
```

