## CSS Snippet

```css
/* Gallery cascade */
.has-gallery {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.has-card {
  transition: opacity 0.35s ease, filter 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease;
}

/* When the gallery contains a hovered card, dim all non-hovered cards */
.has-gallery:has(.has-card:hover) .has-card:not(:hover) {
  opacity: 0.4;
  filter: saturate(0.15) blur(1px);
  transform: scale(0.96);
}

/* Pricing grid */
.pricing-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.pricing-card {
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.pricing-grid:has(.pricing-card:hover) .pricing-card:not(:hover) {
  opacity: 0.45;
  transform: scale(0.94);
}

.pricing-card:hover {
  transform: scale(1.04);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.3);
}

/* Graceful degradation */
@supports not (selector(:has(*))) {
  .has-card,
  .pricing-card {
    /* All cards remain fully visible in unsupported browsers */
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .has-card,
  .pricing-card {
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

