## CSS Snippet

```css
:root {
  --dot-size: 6px;
  --dot-color: #1a1a2e;
  --dot-fill: 40%;
}

.halftone-card {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.halftone-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle,
    var(--dot-color) var(--dot-fill),
    transparent calc(var(--dot-fill) + 1%)
  ) 0 0 / var(--dot-size) var(--dot-size);
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  transition: background-size 0.5s ease, opacity 0.5s ease;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
}

.halftone-card:hover::before {
  background-size: calc(var(--dot-size) * 4) calc(var(--dot-size) * 4);
  opacity: 0;
}

@keyframes halftone-print {
  from {
    background-size: 2px 2px;
    opacity: 1;
  }
  to {
    background-size: var(--dot-size) var(--dot-size);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .halftone-card::before {
    animation: none;
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

