## CSS Snippet

```css
/* Declare layer order — last in list = highest priority */
@layer base, theme, override;

/* base: slow blue pulse */
@layer base {
  .layer-box {
    animation: pulse-blue 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    background: #1d4ed8;
  }
}

/* theme: fast pink bounce */
@layer theme {
  .layer-box {
    animation: bounce-pink 0.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    background: #db2777;
  }
}

/* override: green spin */
@layer override {
  .layer-box {
    animation: spin-green 1.5s linear infinite;
    background: #059669;
  }
}

/* Unlayered: always wins regardless of layer order */
.demo-box--unlayered {
  animation: pulse-orange 0.8s ease infinite alternate;
  background: #d97706;
}

/* Keyframes */
@keyframes pulse-blue   { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }  50% { transform: scale(1.15); } }
@keyframes bounce-pink  { from { transform: translateY(0); }  to  { transform: translateY(-20px); } }
@keyframes spin-green   { to   { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
@keyframes pulse-orange { from { transform: scale(1); }        to  { transform: scale(1.2); filter: brightness(1.3); } }

/* Layout */
.layer-demo {
  padding: 2rem;
  background: #0f172a;
  border-radius: 16px;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
}

.demo-box {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  margin: 1.5rem auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
}

.layer-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: #94a3b8;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .layer-box,
  .demo-box--unlayered {
    animation: none !important;
  }
}
```

