## Description

A button that physically sinks when pressed, simulating the feel of a real mechanical key. On `:active`, the element translates down by a few pixels and the multi-layer `box-shadow` transitions from a large outer raised shadow (representing height) to a compressed inner shadow (representing a pressed surface). The transition is tuned to ~80ms — fast enough to feel physical, not floaty.

