## Why is this useful for EaseMotion CSS?

Interactive affordance is a core part of motion design. A physically convincing press state communicates that something happened — without an icon, colour change, or label update. This pattern is useful for CTAs, game controls, keyboard key displays, and any interface where tactile feedback matters.

