## Description

No submission in this repo uses CSS `steps()` timing for sprite-sheet animation — a technique where `background-position` advances through frames discretely via `animation-timing-function: steps(8, start)`. The submission includes a walk-cycle character (sprite encoded as Base64 inline in CSS for zero external dependencies), a 10-digit number counter using the same steps technique, and a variable-speed demo using `--walk-speed` custom property. Entirely self-contained, no images to host.

