## CSS Snippet

```css
.ease-fold-card {
  position: relative;
  background: #1e293b;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  padding-bottom: 3rem;
  max-width: 280px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

/* The triangular fold flap */
.ease-fold-card::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  border-style: solid;
  border-width: 0 0 40px 40px;
  border-color: transparent transparent #0f172a transparent;
  transition: border-width 0.25s ease;
}

/* The paper underside showing through */
.ease-fold-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  background: #334155;
  clip-path: polygon(100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
  transition: width 0.25s ease, height 0.25s ease;
}

.ease-fold-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
}

.ease-fold-card:hover::after {
  border-width: 0 0 70px 70px;
}

.ease-fold-card:hover::before {
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
}

/* Top-right variant */
.ease-fold-card--top-right::after {
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: auto;
  border-width: 40px 40px 0 0;
  border-color: #0f172a transparent transparent transparent;
}

.ease-fold-card--top-right::before {
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: auto;
  clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%);
}

/* Entrance animation variant */
@keyframes fold-in {
  from { border-width: 0 0 0 0; }
  to   { border-width: 0 0 40px 40px; }
}

.ease-fold-card--animated::after {
  animation: fold-in 0.4s ease-out 0.3s both;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .ease-fold-card::after,
  .ease-fold-card::before { transition: none; }
  .ease-fold-card--animated::after { animation: none; }
}
```

