---

## Description

A card that tilts in 3D on hover using a fixed `rotate3d()` transform — no mouse-position tracking, no JavaScript. The tilt direction and intensity are controlled by CSS custom properties (`--tilt-x`, `--tilt-y`), with four directional variant classes (tilt-top-left, tilt-top-right, tilt-bottom-left, tilt-bottom-right). The transition is smooth and snaps back cleanly on `:hover` end.

