Two separate routes create `CoverLetter` documents:
- `POST /api/cover-letters/generate` (`server/src/modules/coverLetters/controller.js`)
- `POST /api/resume/:id/cover-letter` (`server/src/modules/resumes/coverLetter.controller.js`)

