5. Open the Resume Analyzer History page in the UI — the cover letter history list has no delete button

## Expected Behavior

- Users should be able to delete individual cover letters they no longer need
- A per-user cap (e.g. 20 cover letters) should be enforced to match the pattern used by resumes and analysis history (both capped at 10)

