- Affected file: `server/index.ts`, lines 43–57
- This currently blocks: health check pings from load balancers, `curl`-based smoke tests in CI, any future microservice or background worker that calls this API, and Postman/Insomnia during local development
- The intent (preventing arbitrary browser origins) is still fully met by the `allowedOrigins.includes(origin)` check that already exists

